  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accompanying measures 2007 for sugar protocol countries - Belize</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this AAP is to advance the long-term EC support foreseen in the Multi-Annual EC Assistance Strategy (2006-13) and in particular, to make concrete steps towards improving the economic and social conditions through improving the rural road network, and develop implementation strategies to further improve the efficiency and competitiveness of sugarcane production and promote diversified rural economic growth.</narrative>
  </description>
